WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.400
Clear communication helps
every visitor feel welcome.

2
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.000
Use plain language and short sentences.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.800
Avoid jargon and local abbreviations.

4
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.400
Ask about any accessibility
preferences respectfully,

5
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.000
and offer options such as
written directions

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
or a quieter meeting point.

7
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.600
Speak at a steady pace
and face the visitor.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.400
Check understanding by inviting them

9
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.000
to repeat the key step,

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
not only by asking whether
they understood.

11
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.200
Inclusive communication removes barriers

12
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:52.400
so every visitor can take part.
